{"id":45666,"date":"2025-10-08T08:02:51","date_gmt":"2025-10-08T07:02:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=45666"},"modified":"2026-11-08T13:49:54","modified_gmt":"2026-11-08T12:49:54","slug":"trail-run-real-priolo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-run-real-priolo\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Run Real Priolo 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Run Real Priolo 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Run Real Priolo 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>24 de abril de 2027<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Nordeste<\/strong>, na <strong>Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel (A\u00e7ores)<\/strong>. Organizada pelo <strong>Clube Desportivo e Cultural Juventude Ilha Verde (JIV)<\/strong> em parceria com o <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Nordeste<\/strong> e o <strong>Centro Desportivo e Recreativo de Nordeste (CDRN)<\/strong>, esta prova integra os Circuitos Nacionais da <strong>ATRP (S\u00e9rie 150)<\/strong> de Trail Ultra, Trail, Trail Sprint e Circuito Jovem, atravessando o habitat natural do priolo na Serra da Tronqueira e na floresta Laurissilva.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A partida de todos os escal\u00f5es decorre junto \u00e0 <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Nordeste (Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio)<\/strong> e a meta est\u00e1 instalada na <strong>Escola Secund\u00e1ria de Nordeste<\/strong>. O programa competitivo arranca \u00e0s <strong>07:00<\/strong> com o <strong>Ultra Trail U49 (48,8 km)<\/strong>, seguido \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong> pelo <strong>Trail T30 (30 km)<\/strong>, \u00e0s <strong>09:15<\/strong> pelo <strong>Trail Sprint TS18 (17,7 km)<\/strong>, \u00e0s <strong>10:30<\/strong> pelo <strong>Mini Trail MT12 (12 km)<\/strong> e \u00e0s <strong>10:45<\/strong> pela <strong>Caminhada \/ Percurso Ativo (9,35 km)<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O levantamento de dorsais decorre nos dias <strong>21 e 22 de abril<\/strong> (09:00 \u00e0s 21:00) na sede do Clube Juventude Ilha Verde em Ponta Delgada, no dia <strong>23 de abril<\/strong> (09:00 \u00e0s 17:00) no Posto de Turismo de Nordeste e no dia da prova (06:00 \u00e0s 08:30) em Nordeste. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, seguro desportivo, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica alusiva ao evento, trof\u00e9u ou medalha de finalista, transporte para as partidas (mediante solicita\u00e7\u00e3o) e refei\u00e7\u00e3o conv\u00edvio no final. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">24 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Nordeste, Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel, Nordeste, A\u00e7ores<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-si