is\u00edvel, \u00e1gua e copo\/recipiente pr\u00f3prio.<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 18,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 23,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/02 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Run Real Priolo 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O <strong>Trail Run Real Priolo 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>24 de abril de 2027<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Nordeste<\/strong>, na Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel (A\u00e7ores). As partidas acontecem junto \u00e0 C\u00e2mara Municipal de Nordeste (Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio) e a meta est\u00e1 instalada na Escola Secund\u00e1ria de Nordeste.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida e tempos limite de cada dist\u00e2ncia?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O <strong>Ultra Trail U49 (48,8 km)<\/strong> parte \u00e0s <strong>07:00<\/strong> (limite de 8h00); o <strong>Trail T30 (30 km)<\/strong> parte \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong> (limite de 6h30); o <strong>Trail Sprint TS18 (17,7 km)<\/strong> parte \u00e0s <strong>09:15<\/strong> (limite de 5h00); o <strong>Mini Trail MT12 (12 km)<\/strong> parte \u00e0s <strong>10:30<\/strong> (limite de 3h30); e a <strong>Caminhada (9,35 km)<\/strong> parte \u00e0s <strong>10:45<\/strong>.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail Run Real Priolo 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em 2 fases: <strong>1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 31 de janeiro de 2027)<\/strong> \u2014 32\u20ac (U49), 28\u20ac (T30), 24\u20ac (TS18), 19\u20ac (MT12) e 18\u20ac (Caminhada); e <strong>2\u00aa fase (1 a 28 de fevereiro de 2027)<\/strong> \u2014 37\u20ac (U49), 33\u20ac (T30), 29\u20ac (TS18), 24\u20ac (MT12) e 23\u20ac (Caminhada).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando posso levantar o dorsal (secretariado)?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona nos dias <strong>21 e 22 de abril de 2027<\/strong> (das 09:00 \u00e0s 21:00) na sede do Clube Juventude Ilha Verde em Ponta Delgada (Rua V\u00edtor C\u00e2mara, antiga Escola Prim\u00e1ria do Carv\u00e3o), no dia <strong>23 de abril<\/strong> (das 09:00 \u00e0s 17:00) no Posto de Turismo de Nordeste e no dia <strong>24 de abril<\/strong> (das 06:00 \u00e0s 08:30) no local de partida em Nordeste.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio exigido pelo regulamento?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel com n\u00fameros de emerg\u00eancia, reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua com capacidade m\u00ednima de 0,5 L, mochila ou similar, telem\u00f3vel operacional com saldo, manta t\u00e9rmica de sobreviv\u00eancia, apito, casaco imperme\u00e1vel\/corta-vento e copo pr\u00f3prio (n\u00e3o existem copos descart\u00e1veis nos PACs).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Run Real Priolo 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-